sentences.text:
This I.A. No 158 of 2025 has been filed with the following prayer:-
"Therefore, the Petitioner above named, most respectfully prays that this Hon'ble Court may graciously be pleased to direct the Opp. Party No. 3 for freezing/seizing/attachment of the bank accounts, Demat Accounts, Gold and vehicles of the Opposite Party Nos. 5 and 6 as brought out during the investigation mentioned in the preliminary charge sheet and further investigation, if any,
conducted so far;
AND / OR, pass any other Order(s) / Direction(s) as this Hon'ble Court may deem fit and proper in the best interest of natural justice;
And for this act of kindness, the Petitioner shall be duty- bound and shall ever pray."
